  "details": "It's seemingly impossible to select certain worlds from menus. I've tried selecting these worlds using the Wing Menu \"Worlds\" and Main Menu \"Worlds\" and neither seem to work. When clicking on these worlds it also throws an exception in the console, reading \"Value cannot be null\".\n\nHere's a list of some of the worlds that I discovered that have this issue:\n\nAudioOrbs\n\nAquarius\n\nTreehouse in the Shade\n\nComplex 7\n\nShader Fes 2021\n\nSuper VR Ball",
